{"title": "Heightened Manoeuvre", "pageid": 28659, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Heightened_Manoeuvre", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Heightened Manoeuvre</b> is a passive feature that gives enemies disadvantage against battle master manoeuvre saves.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Targets have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> against your <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Master#Level_3\" title=\"Battle Master\">Manoeuvre</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_Actions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Actions\">Weapon Actions</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlets_of_the_Warmaster\" title=\"Gauntlets of the Warmaster\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f1/Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f1/Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f1/Gloves_of_Metal_E_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlets_of_the_Warmaster\" title=\"Gauntlets of the Warmaster\">Gauntlets of the Warmaster</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The in-game description for <b>Heightened Manoeuvre</b> is arguably incomplete. It affects any action that uses the <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_action_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon action DC\">weapon action DC</a> for its saving throw. This includes:\n<ul><li>Every <a href=\"/wiki/Manoeuvre\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Manoeuvre\">manoeuvre</a></li>\n<li>Almost every <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon action\">weapon action</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stunning_Strike_(Unarmed)\" title=\"Stunning Strike (Unarmed)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp/20px-Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp/30px-Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp/40px-Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunning Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp/20px-Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stunning_Strike_(Unarmed)\" title=\"Stunning Strike (Unarmed)\">Stunning Strike</a> (both unarmed and weapon variants)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Whip\" title=\"Water Whip\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Water_Whip_Icon.webp/20px-Water_Whip_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Water_Whip_Icon.webp/30px-Water_Whip_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Water_Whip_Icon.webp/40px-Water_Whip_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Water Whip\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Water_Whip_Icon.webp/20px-Water_Whip_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Water_Whip_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Water_Whip\" title=\"Water Whip\">Water Whip</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Heightened Manoeuvre does not affect weapon actions that do not involve the weapon action DC. These actions include:\n<ul><li>Every <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Shot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Arcane Shot\">Arcane Shot</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dazzling_Ray\" title=\"Dazzling Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Sunbeam_Icon.webp/20px-Sunbeam_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Sunbeam_Icon.webp/30px-Sunbeam_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Sunbeam_Icon.webp/40px-Sunbeam_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dazzling Ray\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Sunbeam_Icon.webp/20px-Sunbeam_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Sunbeam_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dazzling_Ray\" title=\"Dazzling Ray\">Dazzling Ray</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellflame_Cleave\" title=\"Hellflame Cleave\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp/20px-Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp/30px-Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp/40px-Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellflame Cleave\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp/20px-Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Hellflame_Cleave_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellflame_Cleave\" title=\"Hellflame Cleave\">Hellflame Cleave</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reposition_Malefactor\" title=\"Reposition Malefactor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Reposition_Malefactor_Icon.webp/20px-Reposition_Malefactor_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Reposition_Malefactor_Icon.webp/30px-Reposition_Malefactor_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Reposition_Malefactor_Icon.webp/40px-Reposition_Malefactor_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reposition Malefactor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Reposition_Malefactor_Icon.webp/20px-Reposition_Malefactor_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Reposition_Malefactor_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reposition_Malefactor\" title=\"Reposition Malefactor\">Reposition Malefactor</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zephyr_Break\" title=\"Zephyr Break\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/20px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/30px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/40px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zephyr Break\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/20px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zephyr_Break\" title=\"Zephyr Break\">Zephyr Break</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zephyr_Flash\" title=\"Zephyr Flash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Zephyr_Flash_Icon.webp/20px-Zephyr_Flash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Zephyr_Flash_Icon.webp/30px-Zephyr_Flash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Zephyr_Flash_Icon.webp/40px-Zephyr_Flash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zephyr Flash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Zephyr_Flash_Icon.webp/20px-Zephyr_Flash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Zephyr_Flash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zephyr_Flash\" title=\"Zephyr Flash\">Zephyr Flash</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>The ability to subject opponents of the wearer's manoeuvres to disadvantage is of significant utility to <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Master\" title=\"Battle Master\">Battle Masters</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201022\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2788/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23598/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10215/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 979954/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   50.519      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   50.519      1 -total\n 39.44%   19.927      9 Template:Icon_text\n 38.48%   19.439      8 Template:Icon_link\n 33.82%   17.084     24 Template:Trim\n 29.36%   14.835      7 Template:SmSAI\n 20.07%   10.139     11 Template:Ifempty\n 19.86%   10.033      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 17.59%    8.887      1 Template:Disadvantage\n 16.03%    8.097      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Sav